# one-page-site-builder

For legitimate affiliate / lead-gen / niche site builds, the friction is post-research: you have the domain and the keyword, now you need to ship a one-page site. Manually that's an hour each — copy, hero image, schema markup, OG tags, deploy. This agent does it in minutes.

## Compliance up front

Use this for sites you genuinely operate as your own. Don't use it to build link networks designed to manipulate Google rankings — that's a search-engine guideline violation regardless of the tooling. If you're acquiring an aged domain, do real due diligence on its history (Wayback, Ahrefs anchor profile, prior penalties) and use it for a real project, not as a link source. The skill provides infrastructure; the use case is yours to keep on the right side of search-engine guidelines.

## What it does

1. Reads a job spec: domain, target keyword, niche, intent (affiliate / lead-gen / informational).
2. Drafts page copy via DeepSeek (cheap long-form) following an editorial brief.
3. Generates hero image via OpenAI gpt-image-1 or DALL-E.
4. Generates schema.org markup, OG tags, basic meta.
5. Writes static HTML.
6. Deploys to Cloudflare Pages (or your CDN of choice).
7. Updates DNS at your registrar.
8. Logs the deployment to your inventory.

## Why it works

The bottleneck on niche site builds is logistics, not creative. Compressing the deploy step from an hour to ten minutes lets you ship 50 sites in a week instead of 5.

## What you provide

- Cloudflare account + API token (or alternative CDN).
- Registrar API for DNS (Namecheap, Cloudflare Registrar).
